  "visualTeachingNotes": [
    "A person harvesting grain beside a standing crop and a curved sickle or knife.",
    "Oracle places a plant-like stalk on the left and a separate blade-like form on the right, so the two working components remain distinct.",
    "Regular 利 fixes 禾 on the left and 刂 on the right, preserving the historical pairing of grain and cutting tool in a compact modern compound."
  ],
